#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#A D-Class Sedan with Power Rack and Pinion Steering performs a sinusoidal on-center test at 100 km/h.
#
#This on-center steer test consists of 5 cycles of a sinusoidal path, with smooth (cosine) lead-in and lead-out. The length was chosen to achieve 5 seconds per cycle (0.2 Hz) at 100 kph.
#
#The CarSim Closed-Loop Path Following Driver Model is used to follow the path.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

